# Runtime-generated environment configuration
**/public/runtime-env.json

# Build artifacts

# Compiler emit beside source is not content (REPOSITORY_BASELINE_SPEC.md section 2).
# The negations keep authored ambient declarations committable.
*.js.map
*.d.ts.map
**/src/**/*.js
**/src/**/*.d.ts
**/composed/**/*.js
**/composed/**/*.d.ts
!**/src/**/vite-env.d.ts
!**/src/**/global.d.ts
!**/src/**/shims.d.ts
# `tsconfig.json` includes `scripts` and the pc app root, so those are source
# directories here and tsc emit lands beside them, not only under src/.
sdkwork-notes-pc-react/scripts/**/*.js
sdkwork-notes-pc-react/scripts/**/*.d.ts
